# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Author:        David Gilinsky
# File:          .gitignore
# Purpose:       Git ignore rules: built images, base-image downloads, build and
#                work trees, and secrets (Wi-Fi passphrases, env files).
# Created:       2026-07-26
# Last Modified: 2026-07-26
# Version:       0.1.0
# License:       GPL-3.0-or-later
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Built images (huge; never commit) ----
*.img
*.img.xz
*.img.gz
*.img.zip
*.zip
*.iso
*.wic
*.wic.*

# ---- Base-image downloads / caches ----
/downloads/
/cache/
*.img.xz.sha256
*.sha256

# ---- Build / work / deploy trees ----
/work/
/build/
/deploy/
/stage/
/out/
/tmp/

# ---- pi-gen (if used as a submodule or checkout) ----
pi-gen/work/
pi-gen/deploy/

# ---- Secrets / local configuration ----
# Wi-Fi / AP passphrases and any credentials must never be committed.
*.env
# ...except the pinned build inputs, which carry no secret: the account password
# is generated per build into work/pi-gen.config, and every other credential is
# generated per unit on first boot.
!versions.env
secrets/
*.local
*.local.conf

# ---- Python bytecode (the agent is linted in place) ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- OS / editor ----
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
